    "description": "Rock and Mineral Specimen Lot - 15 Pieces\nGeological Study Collection\nEducational Earth Science Specimens\nThis collection features 15 varied rock and mineral specimens housed in an organized molded compartmental tray with an exterior textured red storage box. Educational rock and mineral kits of this type were commonly assembled for geology students and hobbyists to study crystal habits, streak, luster, and cleavage.\nItems Included:\n15 varied geological specimens including sulfur, quartz, fluorite, feldspar, and metallic ore samples\nIndividual numbered identification stickers affixed to multiple specimens\n15-compartment white molded plastic display tray\nTwo-piece textured maroon red paperboard storage box\nCondition:\nNatural geological specimens show expected raw crystalline and fractured surfaces. Several specimens retain circular numbered collection labels with minor adhesive aging. Storage box displays light exterior corner rubbing and shelf wear, remaining structurally sound.\nThank you for all of your support!",
